  "description": "*Rule #1 of confessing to your crush: Make sure she isn’t gay first.* \n\nWhen Jae-Won’s plan to ask out his dream girl backfires as she suddenly comes out to him, he panics and rambles out an absolute lie: Actually, I'm gay too! Roped into an impossible double date, Jae-Won begs his best friend, Yu-Won, to play the ultimate loving boyfriend for just one night. The plan seems surprisingly foolproof—until the date actually begins. After overhearing a tense private moment between Yu-Won and his crush's new girlfriend, Hyeon-A, Jae-Won makes a horrifying realization: his fake boyfriend and his crush's girl have a history. Caught in a tangled web of exes, lies, and unexpected feelings, Jae-Won’s quick cover-up rapidly devolves into a complete relationship battlefield.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
